window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A new Enemies book in the Amazon top five best-selling series.</p> <p>The one where Aran dances with the devil....<br> <br> Shackled to her Enemies, Aran is forced to compete beside them in the brutal Legionnaire Games.<br> <br> They want to break her. But you can't break what's already broken. Just wait until they uncover her secrets. She'll have them on their knees. <br> <br> In this epic installment, Aran will compete with Sadie and her mates. May the best woman win.</p> <p><i>*This is Aran's Story Book 2 and must be listened to after Psycho Academy.</i></p>"; 
